e>Oligosaccharins&#x02014;structures and signal transduction</article-title><source>Plant Molecular Biology</source><year>1994</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>1379</fpage><lpage>1411</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7858196</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Divol</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Vilaine</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Thibivilliers</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Amselem</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Palauqui</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kusiak</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Dinant</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Systemic response to aphid infestation by Myzus persicae in the phloem of Apium graveolens</article-title><source>Plant Molecular Biology</source><year>2005</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>517</fpage><lpage>540</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15821978</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Doares</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Syrovets</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Weiler</surname><given-names>EW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryan</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oligogalacturonides and chitosan activate plant defensive genes through the octadecanoid pathway</article-title><source>Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, USA</source><year>1995</year><volume>92</volume><fpage>4095</fpage><lpage>4098</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dorokhov</surname><given-names>YL</given-names></name><name><surname>Makinen</surname><given-names>K</given-name